:"黃朗字文達沛郡人也為人弘通有性實父為本縣卒朗感其如此抗志游學由是為方國及其郡士大夫所禮異特與東平右姓王惠陽為碩交惠陽親拜朗母於牀下朗始仕黃初中為長吏遷長安令㑹喪母不赴復為魏令遷襄城典農中郎將涿郡太守以明帝時疾病卒始朗為君長自以父故常忌不呼鈴下伍伯而呼其姓字至於忿怒亦終不言朗既仕至二千石而惠陽亦歴長安令酒泉太守故時人謂惠陽外似麤疏而内堅密能不顧朗之本末事朗母如已母為通度也","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"黃朗","kind":"person","person_id":"rdm_wvl_czs","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"文達","kind":"person","person_id":"rdm_wvl_czs","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0016","start":16,"end":21,"surface":"父為本縣卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"黃朗未名父；不補姓名"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"rdm_wvl_czs","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"王惠陽","kind":"person","person_id":"pa6_1p3_p2c","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"惠陽","kind":"person","person_id":"pa6_1p3_p2c","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"rdm_wvl_czs","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"rdm_wvl_czs","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串規則"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian:p019:m0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"932_46f_026","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"逐單元上下文首讀，不作跨全庫字串